flowchart LR
  Student[Student / Reviewer] -->|HTTPS| ALB[ALB + NGINX ingress]
  ALB --> API[Stateless FastAPI API]
  API --> PG[(RDS PostgreSQL)]
  API --> S3[(Private S3 assets)]
  API --> Outbox[(Transactional outbox)]
  Outbox --> Relay[Outbox relay]
  Relay --> Q[SQS evaluation queue]
  Q --> W[Isolated evaluation workers]
  W --> S3
  W --> PG
  W --> Parser[Safe extract / parse]
  Parser --> Index[Chunk + metadata + embeddings]
  Index --> V[(pgvector / full-text)]
  W --> LLM[Provider adapter / hosted LLM]
  API --> Notify[Notification adapter]
  W --> Notify
  API --> Obs[Logs, metrics, traces, alarms]
  W --> Obs
